-options_left
-on_error_abort
-ksp_error_if_not_converged

-hard_pc_type fieldsplit
-hard_ksp_type fgmres
-hard_ksp_monitor_true_residual
-hard_ksp_rtol 1.e-9
-hard_ksp_atol 1.e-20
-hard_ksp_converged_reason
-hard_ksp_max_it 10000


